    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="1226" n="1076" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg1076"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul-General Iddings to the Assistant Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Agency and Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Cairo, Egypt</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1906-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December
                                16, 1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 147.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm herein the
                    telegram sent to you by me on November 26<anchor n="a" xml:id="d435-f1"/> last,
                    and your reply received December 1.<anchor n="a" xml:id="d435-f2"/></p>
                <pb facs="1227" n="1077" xml:id="pg1077"/>
                <p>I received from the Egyptian government the note dated December 6, of which I
                    forward a copy, with translation, attaching to it copy of my reply, dated
                    December 8. I have called formally on Mr. Alban to express my regret that he
                    should be attacked as he has been by an American citizen.</p>
                <p>Awaiting your further instructions, I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis Morris
                    Iddings.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d435-a1.xml" xpointer="d435-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d435-a2.xml" xpointer="d435-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
